  "ground_truth": {
    "defect": true,
    "category": "resource-leak",
    "severity": [
      "medium",
      "high"
    ],
    "explanation": "HandleGetOrderHistory returns on a 404 upstream status before the `defer resp.Body.Close()` line, which sits after the not-found check instead of right after the error check as in HandleGetOrder and the new fetchOrder/decodeOrder helpers. Every account with no orders yet leaks one HTTP response body (and, with a keep-alive transport, ties up a connection) per request to this new endpoint."
  },
